18.json", "paragraphs": ["ガーディアンズの先発ガビン・ウィリアムズは12個の三振を奪った。ラミレスの2ラン本塁打が唯一の得点だった。土曜日の夜、クリーブランドはシカゴ・ホワイトソックスを2-0で破り、5試合制のアメリカンリーグ地区シリーズで2連敗から逆転勝ちした。", "クリーブランドは月曜日の夜、タンパベイでリーグ優勝決定シリーズに臨む。2016年以来のワールドシリーズ出場を目指す。ガーディアンズ（旧インディアンス）は1948年から優勝しておらず、これはMLBで最も長い優勝なしの期間だ。"], "paragraphs_zh": ["守护者队先发加文·威廉姆斯投出12次三振。拉米雷斯的两分本垒打是唯一得分。周六晚，克利夫兰以2比0击败芝加哥白袜队，在五战三胜的美联分区系列赛中从两连败翻盘取胜。", "克利夫兰将于周一晚在坦帕湾参加联盟冠军系列赛。他们力争自2016年以来首次打进世界大赛。守护者队（前印第安人队）自1948年以来未夺冠，这是MLB最长无冠纪录。"], "body": "ガーディアンズの先発ガビン・ウィリアムズは12個の三振を奪った。ラミレスの2ラン本塁打が唯一の得点だった。土曜日の夜、クリーブランドはシカゴ・ホワイトソックスを2-0で破り、5試合制のアメリカンリーグ地区シリーズで2連敗から逆転勝ちした。\n\nクリーブランドは月曜日の夜、タンパベイでリーグ優勝決定シリーズに臨む。2016年以来のワールドシリーズ出場を目指す。ガーディアンズ（旧インディアンス）は1948年から優勝しておらず、これはMLBで最も長い優勝なしの期間だ。", "body_zh": "守护者队先发加文·威廉姆斯投出12次三振。拉米雷斯的两分本垒打是唯一得分。周六晚，克利夫兰以2比0击败芝加哥白袜队，在五战三胜的美联分区系列赛中从两连败翻盘取胜。\n\n克利夫兰将于周一晚在坦帕湾参加联盟冠军系列赛。他们力争自2016年以来首次打进世界大赛。守护者队（前印第安人队）自1948年以来未夺冠，这是MLB最长无冠纪录。", "text": "ガーディアンズの先発ガビン・ウィリアムズは12個の三振を奪った。ラミレスの2ラン本塁打が唯一の得点だった。土曜日の夜、クリーブランドはシカゴ・ホワイトソックスを2-0で破り、5試合制のアメリカンリーグ地区シリーズで2連敗から逆転勝ちした。 クリーブランドは月曜日の夜、タンパベイでリーグ優勝決定シリーズに臨む。2016年以来のワールドシリーズ出場を目指す。ガーディアンズ（旧インディアンス）は1948年から優勝しておらず、これはMLBで最も長い優勝なしの期間だ。", "vocab": [{"word": "三振", "pos": "noun", "zh": "三振出局", "note": "棒球术语，指击球手被投手三振", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "本塁打", "pos": "noun", "zh": "本垒打", "note": "棒球得分方式，球被打出全垒打墙", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "逆転", "pos": "noun", "zh": "逆转，翻盘", "note": "常用词，指局势反转", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "地区シリーズ", "pos": "noun", "zh": "分区系列赛", "note": "MLB季后赛阶段之一", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "リーグ優勝決定シリーズ", "pos": "noun", "zh": "联盟冠军系列赛", "note": "决定联盟冠军的系列赛", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "ワールドシリーズ", "pos": "noun", "zh": "世界大赛", "note": "MLB年度总冠军赛", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "出場", "pos": "noun", "zh": "出场，参加", "note": "常与比赛、活动搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "優勝", "pos": "noun", "zh": "夺冠，优胜", "note": "体育比赛中获得第一", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "記録", "pos": "noun", "zh": "纪录", "note": "指成绩、数据", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "先発", "pos": "noun", "zh": "先发，首发", "note": "棒球中指先发投手", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "セーブ", "pos": "noun", "zh": "救援成功", "note": "棒球术语，指终结比赛", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "敗退", "pos": "noun", "zh": "被淘汰，败退", "note": "指在比赛中被淘汰出局", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Williams strikes out 12 as Guardians blank White Sox to complete ALDS comeback", "summary_original": "Williams fans 12 as Cleveland win decisive Game 5\nRamírez’s two-run homer provides only scoring\nGuardians to face Rays for place in World Series\nGavin Williams struck out 12, José Ramírez homered on a pitch just above home plate and the Cleveland Guardians beat the Chicago White Sox 2-0 on Saturday night to complete a comeback from a 2-0 deficit in their best-of-five American League Division Series.\nCleveland open the American League Championship Series at Tampa Bay on Monday night, seeking their first World Series appearance since 2016. The Guardians/Indians franchise have not won the title since 1948, the longest drought among MLB teams.\nContinue reading...", "body_original": "Williams strikes out 12 as Guardians blank White Sox to complete ALDS comeback\nWilliams fans 12 as Cleveland win decisive Game 5\nRamírez’s two-run homer provides only scoring\nGuardians to face Rays for place in World Series\nGavin Williams struck out 12, José Ramírez homered on a pitch just above home plate and the\nCleveland Guardians\nbeat the Chicago White Sox 2-0 on Saturday night to complete a comeback from a 2-0 deficit in their best-of-five American League Division Series.\nCleveland open the American League Championship Series at Tampa Bay on Monday night, seeking their first World Series appearance since 2016. The Guardians/Indians franchise have not won the title since 1948, the longest drought among\nMLB\nteams.\nGuardians pitchers struck out 21, the most in a nine-inning postseason game. The White Sox managed just three hits, putting only nine balls in play, and struck out 75 times over the series.\nTwo days after getting the save in Game 4, Williams became just the third pitcher in postseason history to get the last out of a game and start the following game when his team faced elimination in both.\nHe did not allow a hit until Kyle Teel looped a knuckle-curve into right field with two outs in the sixth, two innings after Ramírez homered for the second straight game, a two-run drive off Sean Burke.\nAfter a walk loaded the bases, Erik Sabrowski relieved Williams and struck out Munetaka Murakami.\nWilliams’s 12 strikeouts tied Cleveland’s record for a postseason game. He got 22 swings and misses, and his 24 strikeouts over three games tied for the second most in a best-of-five postseason series.\nHunter Gaddis followed Sabrowski and got four outs. Cade Smith finished for his first career five-out save, striking out the side in the ninth. He blew a fastball by Tristan Peters for the final out, setting off a celebration at Progressive Field.\nChicago, the first team to reach the playoffs after three straight 100-loss seasons, have not won the World Series since 2005.\nExplore more on these topics\nMLB\nCleveland Guardians\nChicago White Sox\nBaseball\nUS sports\nShare\nReuse this content", "fetched_at": "2026-10-12T00:46:14.061014", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "ガーディアンズ", "s": 0.125, "e": 0.825, "sm": 125, "em": 825, "cs": 0, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "の", "s": 0.838, "e": 0.963, "sm": 837, "em": 962, "cs": 7, "ce": 8, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "先発", "s": 0.975, "e": 1.5, "sm": 975, "em": 1500, "cs": 8, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "ガビン", "s": 1.512, "e": 1.862, "sm": 1512, "em": 1862, "cs": 10, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "・", "s": 1.862, "e": 2.188, "sm": 1862, "em": 2187, "cs": 13, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "ウィリアムズ", "s": 2.188, "e": 2.763, "sm": 2187, "em": 2762, "cs": 14, "ce": 20, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "は", "s": 2.775, "e": 3.0, "sm": 2775, "em": 3000, "cs": 20, "ce": 21, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "12", "s": 3.1, "e": 